  "details": "Mistune from 3.3.0 before 3.3.4 contains a denial of service vulnerability that allows remote attackers to exhaust CPU through quadratic-time emphasis delimiter processing. Attackers can submit small markdown documents with repeated patterns like \"*a_b\" to trigger an O(n²) index-fixup loop, stalling workers for seconds.",
